<title>JAPAN: Honda April domestic output up 23.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Honda April domestic output up 23.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Honda Motor Co Ltd said on Thursday its domestic vehicle production rose 23.3 percent from a year earlier to 107,771 units in April.  </p>
<p>Honda's domestic vehicle production, exports, domestic sales and overseas output in April were as follows:</p>
<p>    Production	  107,771   up	23.3 percent</p>
<p>    Domestic sales     59,253   down     4.0 percent</p>
<p>    Exports		46,483   up	70.8 percent</p>
<p>    Overseas output    95,000   up	 1.1 percent</p>
</text>
